# No demo data is ever committed: the build script rebuilds it from the public sources. The patterns cover the
# default output, the `--out` names a walkthrough or a CI job might pass, and the half-built file `build-data.mjs`
# renames into place at the end of a successful run.
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.duckdb.building
*.duckdb.building.wal
data/raw/**
data/
*.parquet
*.csv.zip

# The Instance itself is tracked, Findings included — a retained input or provenance file under a Finding is
# reviewed material, not a download, even when it carries one of the extensions above.
!analytics/findings/**
